# Copy this file to .env and fill in your real values.
# Vite requires the VITE_ prefix to expose env vars to the browser.

# Optional server-only write access for persisting refreshed prices.
# The price feed can read public references and fetch source quotes using the
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL and VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY below without a service-role key.
# Make those values available to Netlify Functions as well as the build.
# Update scripts still require the server-only service-role key.
